#, c-format
msgid "Installed %s\n"
msgstr "Nainstalováno %s\n"

#: src/cli/main.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"No browser or mail client profile was found for this user, so nothing was "
"installed. Start Firefox, Thunderbird, or Chromium once and run this again.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pro tohoto uživatele nebyl nalezen žádný profil prohlížeče ani poštovního "
"klienta, takže se nic nenainstalovalo. Spusťte jednou Firefox, Thunderbird "
"nebo Chromium a zkuste to znovu.\n"

#: src/cli/main.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Restart the browser or mail client to pick this up.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Restartujte prohlížeč nebo poštovního klienta, aby se změna projevila.\n"

